/Title (Across the day, discussions repeatedly returned to questions of democracy, accountability and power. Participants considered how data infrastructures increasingly shape public institutions, redistribute authority, and challenge existing understandings of transparency, sovereignty, and public governance. Rather than offering definitive answers, the event underscored the need for continued interdisciplinary dialogue between researchers, policymakers, practitioners, and the public.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 323 0 R
/Next 294 0 R
>>
endobj
